      "scenario_id": "scen.delivery_operations",
      "name": "Delivery application operations review",
      "summary": "A fictional delivery application team reviews supplied build, deployment and operations evidence in an approved sandbox case. The application is delivery-api; publisher, consumer and log-reader roles are delivery-publisher, delivery-consumer and delivery-log-reader. All records and identifiers are authored, not real AWS observations. Learners inspect excerpts, configurations and read-only tables; no shell, cloud service, credentials or resources are provisioned. CodeBuild, CodeDeploy, load-balancer, log-retention, database-restore, IAM-denial and validation examples can be carried as plain-text code/config/log evidence in interactions; their scaffolding requires no executable assets.",
